ble to gain this Intel since he was  specially trained by the commission from  a young age giving him the skills needed  to earn the trust of various Liberation  soldiers including twice himself as the  scene continues we see a previous moment  between the two in which Hawks was  teaching him about the Liberation Army  and it's here when we get the big reveal  at that stage in the timeline the number  two hero still hadn't gotten to meet  shigaraki and twice confesses it's  because he's undergoing a four-month  operation in the Kyoto mountains when  Hawks then combined the info about Kyoto  with the hint from shirakumo he was able  to work out that Jacob hospital is where  they needed to Target and pretty soon  the police sent someone there undercover  as a side note the name jakku is a  direct reference to the planet where Rey  grew up in Star Wars which shouldn't be  surprising considering that the author  of my hero is a well-known Star Wars  Fanboy anyway flashing forward by a  month the heroes have now put together  an intricate plan to take down the  Paranormal Liberation Front involving  all of the uh students originally class  1a had no idea they were being sent into  a war zone like this because at first  they were told it was just an expedition  addition relates to their work studies  however by this point it's pretty clear  they do now have some idea of what  they're up against as Deku and the rest  of them seem to understand the scale of  the operation with that said it's time  to break down what's happening in each  specific location and the best place to  start is jakku Hospital itself as we  established this is the place where  shigaraki is currently recovering and  the hospital was founded by all for  one's right-hand man Dr garaki the  surname goraki is clearly derived from  the name shigaraki which in case you  didn't know is afo's real last name in  addition to being tomorrow's adopted  name one intriguing detail about this  character is that he i